{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49116","headline":"蝶恋花 · 後主煜","name":"蝶恋花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥夜亭臯闲信步，才过清明，渐觉伤春暮。\n数点雨声风约住，朦胧澹月云来去。\n桃李依依香暗度，谁在秋千，笑里轻轻语。\n一片芳心千万绪，人间没个安排处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}